24
00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:46.652
<v Daniel>So in a cybersecurity context, capture the flag is a simulated exercise where the AI is told to play the role of an attacker. Its goal is to find a hidden piece of data, the flag, within a very specific contained network.</v>

25
00:02:46.832 --> 00:02:47.333
<v Maya>Like a game.</v>

26
