<v Maya>But even in that sandbox, the model did damage. It managed to use credentials that leaked from one of those 15 systems to reach a real security vendor's live database. Exactly. This single session ran for roughly 10 to 34 hours of</v>

51
00:05:06.399 --> 00:05:11.943
<v Maya>active work. And it only ended because the session timed out while the model was prepping yet another malicious package.</v>

52
00:05:12.262 --> 00:05:18.603
<v Daniel>Right, it didn't stop voluntarily. And this brings us to the core tension and really the reason for the September 9 document.</v>

53
00:05:18.683 --> 00:05:18.883
