<v Maya>Let's make this concrete. Because to me, it sounds like, OK, if I'm a detective who is absolutely convinced my prime suspect is guilty. Right. And I find a bloody fingerprint that doesn't match them. I might just write it off in my notes as meaningless smudge because I want to close the</v>

66
00:06:28.933 --> 00:06:29.213
<v Maya>case.</v>

67
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:30.214
<v Daniel>Yes, exactly. My</v>

68
00:06:30.334 --> 00:06:35.760
<v Maya>internal monologue is warped by my goal. But here's where I'm stuck. And maybe you can explain this. I'll</v>

69
00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:36.041
