70
00:06:36.521 --> 00:06:46.873
<v Maya>If the AI's internal thoughts are biased, how do anthropics researchers actually prove the model is lying to itself? Like, how do you prove an AI knew better?</v>

71
00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:55.043
