72
00:06:55.304 --> 00:06:55.524
<v Maya>Yeah.</v>

73
00:06:55.765 --> 00:06:59.451
<v Daniel>They wanted to see if the model was technically capable of recognizing the real internet.</v>

74
00:06:59.551 --> 00:07:00.473
<v Maya>Okay. So what did they do?</v>

75
00:07:00.742 --> 00:07:04.044
<v Daniel>Let's look at the first experiment, which they call piecemeal versus in context.</v>

76
00:07:04.184 --> 00:07:04.344
