91
00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:28.714
<v Daniel>Oh yeah, these are great.</v>

92
00:08:28.754 --> 00:08:36.641
<v Maya>They took the original transcript, rewound it, and edited the text to inject glaring, obvious clues that the environment was real.</v>

