94
00:08:38.743 --> 00:08:53.254
<v Maya>Yeah. Then they hit play to see how the model would react. And adding those realism cues actually made the model more likely to admit in its thoughts that the environment might be real. but and here's the crazy part it did not change its actions it kept</v>

