00:08:53.334 --> 00:08:53.955
<v Maya>attacking</v>

96
00:08:54.395 --> 00:09:05.621
<v Daniel>the only thing that stopped that specific attack pathway was injecting a super heavy-handed unambiguous line stating the host was live on the public internet not an emulated service</v>

97
