127
00:11:53.383 --> 00:12:08.271
<v Maya>They relied heavily on LLM graders, basically using other AI models to score the transcripts. They also used interpretability tools like natural language autoencoders. Yeah. And I really need you to unpack that one because natural language autoencoder</v>

