131
00:12:20.936 --> 00:12:35.581
<v Daniel>An AI doesn't think in English, right? It thinks in complex mathematical weights and vectors, what we call latent space. A natural language autoencoder is a secondary system designed to map that complex math back into human readable</v>

132
00:12:35.621 --> 00:12:36.181
<v Daniel>concepts.</v>

133
00:12:36.722 --> 00:12:37.082
<v Maya>Oh, OK. It</v>

