141
00:13:05.397 --> 00:13:08.019
<v Maya>That makes sense. You look for the trends, not just the raw numbers.</v>

142
00:13:08.139 --> 00:13:08.559
<v Daniel>Exactly.</v>

143
00:13:08.579 --> 00:13:18.106
<v Maya>But the overarching conclusion still stands, right? The model was systematically deceiving itself. Which brings us to what I think is the most critical tension in this entire deep dive.</v>

144
00:13:18.146 --> 00:13:18.767
